    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9943" root="خبط" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْبَطٌ</span></b>  <i>A staff,</i> or <i>stick, with which the leaves
of trees are beaten off:</i> (K:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْبَطَةٌ</span></b> , also,
signifies <i>a staff,</i> or <i>stick;</i> and <i>a rod,</i> or <i>twig:</i>
(TA:) pl. of the former, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَابِطُ</span>. (K, TA.)

